  <event id="93">
      <start>14:00</start>
      <duration>00:45</duration>
      <room>AW1.105</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Jaiku: Jabber the mobile</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Jabber</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;How to map a desktop IM protocol for mobile use: &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.jaiku.com/&#34;&gt;Jaiku&lt;/a&gt; combines rich presence and group messaging on the web and on the mobile, powered by Jabber.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After an introduction into Jaiku, this presentation shows how Jaiku uses XMPP protocols and highlights the associated challenges, touching on network coverage, battery usage, sporadic attention, low input-rates.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The presentation closes with a small demo.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="931">Mika Raento</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>